Depends: bash (>= 4.0), curl, git, python3, python3-psutil, python3-requests, python3-colorama, inxi, pciutils, net-tools, sysstat, mesa-utils, upower, wmctrl, x11-xserver-utils, libglib2.0-bin, lolcat
Recommends: python3-pip
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/yonasuriv/sonda
Description: System and Network Information Tool
 Sonda is a comprehensive system information utility for Linux that provides
 real-time monitoring and detailed system/network information in a clean,
 terminal-based interface.
 .
 Features:
  - System information (CPU, RAM, storage, hardware specs)
  - Network details (interfaces, IPs, connections, firewall status)
  - Package management monitoring
  - Real-time system health monitoring
  - Process viewer
  - Clean, readable terminal interface
  - Modular, extensible architecture
